{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00318","headline":"保大五年元日大雪同太弟景遂汪王景逷齐王景逵进士李建勳中书徐铉勤政殿学士张义方登楼赋 · 嗣主璟","name":"保大五年元日大雪同太弟景遂汪王景逷齐王景逵进士李建勳中书徐铉勤政殿学士张义方登楼赋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"珠帘高卷莫轻遮，往往相逢隔岁华。\n春气昨宵飘律管，东风今日放梅花。\n素姿好把芳姿掩，落势还同舞势斜。\n坐有宾朋尊有酒，可怜清味属侬家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"嗣主璟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00318.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00318","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}